<title>HUNGARY: FORECAST-Hungary govt paper yields seen down.</title>
<headline>FORECAST-Hungary govt paper yields seen down.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Most Hungarian treasury-bill and government bond yields were expected to drop at this week's auctions, traders said on Monday.</p>
<p>The government debt management agency (AKK) will auction one-month T-bills on Tuesday, three-month T-bills on Wednesday, and three-year and seven-year bonds on Thursday.</p>
